  cs:cosItem <https://w3id.org/jp-cos/8350233121200000>,<https://w3id.org/jp-cos/8350233121210000>,<https://w3id.org/jp-cos/8350233121220000>,<https://w3id.org/jp-cos/8350233121230000>,<https://w3id.org/jp-cos/8350233121240000>;
